## Status
- Created: 2025-03-31
- Phase: 2
- Priority: High
- **MODULE NOT LINKED** (discovered 2026-04-09)

**Note (2026-04-09):** Issue describes mod-talent-bonus module implementation, but:
- Module exists at `modules/mod-talent-bonus/` (local)
- Module NOT linked to `source-beta/modules/` (not compiled)
